      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "Research is a very important topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "no matter if you work on a private or professional project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "if you start a new hobby, if you wanna write a book,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "whatever you wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "you always have to research information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "The awesome news is that with ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 23.18,
          "en": "research becomes easier and more efficient than ever before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "So let's get started with a practical research example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 29.67,
          "en": "My goal is to learn more about the world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 31.17,
          "en": "and about everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "For this, I wanna find a new book",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 35.85,
          "en": "that everybody should have read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "To be able to choose between different books here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 41.79,
          "en": "I will ask ChatGPT the following prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.79,
          "end": 45.93,
          "en": "What are the top five books everybody should have read?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.93,
          "end": 47.67,
          "en": "A quite generic prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.67,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "but let's see what the result looks like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 54.18,
          "en": "ChatGPT comes up with five books here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "also stating that it's difficult to pick just five books.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 58.95,
          "en": "So in the end it tells us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 61.77,
          "en": "it depends on what we are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "But we got five books to get started with already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 68.4,
          "en": "As we learned in the prompt engineering module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 72.09,
          "en": "we should be more specific about what we actually look for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.09,
          "end": 74.82,
          "en": "So we should add some constraints to our prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 78,
          "en": "maybe to be more precise about the topics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78,
          "end": 80.73,
          "en": "about the segment we are interested in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.73,
          "end": 83.76,
          "en": "And let's say that we are actually interested into books",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.76,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "which are related to business or personal development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "And in addition to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "I just want to have the book title only,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
